  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection and GBV Response Services to Women and Children in Iraq II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of this programme (Phase II) is to ensure that women and children affected by conflict in Iraq have improved access to the services necessary for healing and recovery from GBV, including in particular SGBV, and face reduced risks in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
